# Workspace-root .claudeignore — scopes Grep/Glob/Explore for ORCH sessions.
#
# WHY THIS FILE EXISTS AT THE WORKSPACE ROOT AND NOT ONLY IN repo/:
# the 2026-07-24 token pass shipped a .claudeignore at the SITE repo root, but the
# ORCH session's cwd is the WORKSPACE root, so every Grep/Glob issued by the
# orchestrator ran unfiltered across the whole tree. Measured 2026-08-12:
# .wt/ alone held 114 subdirectories, each a full repo copy, so a single Grep
# matched the same file dozens of times over.
#
# DO NOT ADD (each is read live and excluding it causes false absences):
#   board/                      status is the directory; the ORCH reads it every turn
#   research/                   live verdict docs, cited by rows
#   archive/                    referenced by HEARTBEAT history trims
#   mcp-apps-poc/data|kernels   SSOT reads for vendor/parity checks
#   repo/chaingraph/            kernels + standard are searched constantly
#
# A repo-scoped search already produces FALSE ABSENCES across four repos; this file
# must never widen that failure mode. When in doubt, leave it searchable.

# --- worktrees: full repo copies, the dominant multiplier ---
.wt/
.worktrees/
.worktrees-mcp/
worktrees/
worktrees-worker/
wt-*/
wave*-archived/
.claude/worktrees-worker/

# --- vendor/scratch run dirs ---
.vendor-run-*/
.scratch/
.verifier_out/
.tools/

# --- git internals and mirrors ---
**/.git/
.internal.git/

# --- dependency trees and lockfiles ---
**/node_modules/
**/package-lock.json
**/pnpm-lock.yaml
**/yarn.lock

# --- binaries and archives ---
**/*.zip
**/*.tar
**/*.tar.gz
**/*.gz
**/*.exe
**/*.dll
**/*.so
**/*.wasm
**/*.png
**/*.jpg
**/*.jpeg
**/*.gif
**/*.pdf
**/*.ico
**/*.woff
**/*.woff2
